# METER Security

- Input-validate every API body and query (`q` required for research).
- Secrets only via env; never hardcode; never echo in logs or UI.
- Subaccounts: `withdrawalsRestricted: true` always.
- Daily cap + call ceiling enforced before debit.
- Atomic ledger writes (temp file + rename).
- Residual risk to document: key leakage, facilitator trust, host WAF, prompt injection on agent tooling, file-ledger single-host durability.
- Forbidden phrasing: "unhackable", "North Korea can't hack", "zero bugs forever".
